   "bodytext_html": "During the action time of one week, a 3x6 m HIV writing was destroyed, while an <br />angel-like figure grew out of the debris.<br /><br />The campaign 'Zerstöre HIV' was initiated for the World AIDS Day 2013.<br />It was entirely designed to be presented to, and interactively controlled by the <br />audience on social media. \r\nConcept by Jugend gegen Aids and Deepblue Networks, Hamburg<br />Realisation with Horst Steel /D, KAI /D and Uri Moss /IL, November 2013, Alte Münze, <br />Berlin /D",
