   "title": "Derevo, Wheel of Power",
   "year": "2007",
   "header": "Derevo, Wheel of Power, 2007",
   "bodytext_html": "For the 400th anniversary of the city of Mannheim, Theatrical masters Derevo /RU produced <br />a full evening of spectacular with AKHE theatre from St. Petersburg and a collaboration of <br />installation artist called Robodock Crew based around Tom van der Stelt /NL. <br /><br />For their part, the Robodock Crew designed and animated the outdoor space of an abandoned <br />railway station with bars, sculptures, machines and various fire performances.\r\nThe Robodock crew was: Tom van der Stelt /NL, Daan /NL, Doyle /USA, Jens Schendel a.k.a. <br />Horst Steel /D, Luca Minotti /CH, Martin Cypritch /CZ, Marco Collabucci /I, Wout Rockx /NL, <br />Ymar /NL, Rael /NL, Maja Explosiv /CH",
   "text_uid": 1263,
   "text_uids": [
    1263,
    1446
   ],
